  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two small spheres each of mass 10 kg are 8.0 m apart and connected by a rod of negligible mass.</p>\n<p>This system rotates about an axis halfway along the rod and at right angles to it.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the moment of inertia of the system?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">160 kg m<sup>2</sup></li><li data-label=\"B\">320 kg m<sup>2</sup></li><li data-label=\"C\">640 kg m<sup>2</sup></li><li data-label=\"D\">1280 kg m<sup>2</sup></li></ol>"
  },
